    {
      "text": "name of Apostle of the Lamb is John, 1 Ne. 14:27. hearken, O house of Jacob, who are called by name of Israel, 1 Ne. 20:1 (Isa. 48:1). name of latter-day seer shall be called after Joseph1, and after name of his father, 2 Ne. 3:15. Benjamin gives his people name to distinguish them, never to be blotted out, Mosiah 1:11–12 (5:9–12). children of Amulon and brethren are no longer called after names of fathers, take name of Nephi, Mosiah 25:12. names of unrepentant transgressors are blotted out, Mosiah 26:36 (Alma 1:24; 5:57; Moro. 6:7). names of wicked shall not be numbered among names of righteous, Alma 5:57. converted Lamanites call their name Anti-Nephi-Lehies, Alma 23:17. I have given you names of first parents who came out of Jerusalem, Hel. 5:6. if church is called in name of man, it is church of man, 3 Ne. 27:8. the Lord forbids that names of Three Nephites be written, 3 Ne. 28:25.",
